linear ramp: fills 1 gradients 1 close true
   linear steps 0
radial ramp: fills 1 gradients 1 close true
   radial steps 0
stepped ramp: fills 1 gradients 1 close true
   linear steps 5
hard shadow: fills 2 gradients 0 close true
linear ramp, gradients off: fills 7 gradients 0 close true
trace: gradients must be true or false
trace: gradient_error must be more than 0
